Z||000000||tripstaatnod||09-16-2001||10:20 PM||||I have a 85' Gt and it has a like plate on the handle that says "Limited Edition" on it! I have a pic below if it worked right. I've never seen it on any other Fiero. If you know what it means I'm really curious. Thanks<P><BR> <IMG SRC="http://communities.msn.com/_Secure/0QAAgVMoU1Gl4z6Q0liEG0OOTW*iMZeF1EZbidswGX!ITXYTRouVaUkh3F9mxksSIuitz4buKe!Bw2ampFUkp0GldtsIu4cuuM19TTS5naWY/MVC-014F(1).jpg"> <BR>||||reg||1
